<p>His family had a long association with military service. Forbes' great uncle was Lt. Colonel James MacDonell, the hero of Hougomont, during the Battle of Waterloo in 1815. One of many mysteries is why Forbes never sought promotion. He was within months of his discharge at the time of his death.Whatever crime or scandal, Forbes may have left England in disgrace, but he died a hero.</p>

